# --- Local-only model / vector index / knowledge originals ---
# The repository publishes code, docs, tests and small evaluation fixtures only.
# Knowledge originals are not redistributed because their redistribution rights
# are unclear; the model and Chroma index are large local assets.
assets/models/*
!assets/models/README.md
assets/rag_index/*
!assets/rag_index/README.md
assets/knowledge/*
!assets/knowledge/README.md

# --- Generated evidence / run sessions / manual review originals ---
outputs/
eval/results/
eval/reviews/
eval/judge_results/
eval/runs/
runtime/data/
runtime/outputs/
*.log
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.zip

